    <briefdescription>
<para>A Last-Write-Wins Register. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Writes with a strictly higher timestamp win. On equal timestamps the lexicographically-greater node ID is preferred (tie-break).</para>
